---
import Book from '../layouts/Book.astro';import{lessons,label}from'../lib/content';
const main=lessons.filter(l=>l.path==='main');
---
<Book title="Recommended main path"><span class="eyebrow">ONE COHERENT TRAVERSAL</span><h1>Recommended main path</h1><p class="dek">Start with Deutsch and Grover. Expand a missing prerequisite when the current calculation needs it.</p><div class="context-box"><p>A branch is optional for the main narrative, not a judgment of its importance. A later chapter may depend on a branch; follow its explicit prerequisite links when you reach it.</p><p>Keep a one-sentence checkpoint: “We are trying to learn ___, this operation changes ___, and the next measurement reveals ___.”</p></div><ol class="catalog-list">{main.map(l=><li><a href={`/lessons/${l.id}/`}>{label(l)}</a><p>{l.summary}</p>{l.editorial==='partial'&&<span class="badge partial">Partial · see specific gaps</span>}</li>)}</ol><p><a href="/index/">Browse every branch and family →</a></p></Book>
